o di vent’anni di incontri, successi ed errori, la loro relazione evolve finché scoprono che l’amore può nascere nei luoghi più inaspettati — proprio nel mondo di Carosello e delle storie televisive che hanno segnato una generazione."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Carosello in Love","overview":"Laura, idealistic and passionate about television, and Mario, a rebellious director who dreams of cinema, start out clashing but gradually develop mutual respect and affection. Over twenty years of encounters, successes, and mistakes, their relationship evolves until they discover that love can appear in the most unexpected places—right in the world of Carosello and the TV stories that marked a generation."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/heqMk6UbPHfynLvt2YnjWMGYsTo.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qnuF3jM2CKqudSpaekgrGDjgeGW.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1589762,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/heqMk6UbPHfynLvt2YnjWMGYsTo.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/heqMk6UbPHfynLvt2YnjWMGYsTo.jpg","language":"it","width":733,"height":1100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/heqMk6UbPHfynLvt2YnjWMGYsTo.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/heqMk6UbPHfynLvt2YnjWMGYsTo.jpg","language":"it","width":733,"height":1100}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/noNRgzuE477lhSt7jnnUGw7bOtW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/noNRgzuE477lhSt7jnnUGw7bOtW.jpg","language":"xx","width":527,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/noNRgzuE477lhSt7jnnUGw7bOtW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb